For the proposal, I’ll use a 2026-09-09 cutoff with explicit archived-debt reporting. That means the new rule creates no day-one failures for unchanged existing entries; the nine evidenced cases become visible migration work. New or changed entries must carry a complete declaration, so a missing marker cannot make the rule silently skip them.
